      "name": "How do I find my septic tank?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Professional locators use electronic locators, ground-penetrating radar (GPR), and specialized probing equipment to find buried tanks. Electronic locators trace signals from sewer lines, GPR sends radio waves to detect underground structures, and probing uses specialized rods to physically locate tank edges."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How much does it cost to locate a septic tank?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
