      "name": "Why do I need to know where my septic tank is?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Knowing tank location is essential for maintenance, repairs, and preventing expensive damage during landscaping or construction. Accurate location allows efficient access for pumping, inspection, and repairs, reducing service costs. It prevents accidental damage during digging that can cost thousands to repair."
